    <item>
      <title>欧盟顶级外交官在寻找乌克兰的弹药方面取得了进展</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/eu-top-diplomat-hails-progress-in-finding-ammunition-for-ukraine</link>
      <description><![CDATA[欧盟最高的外交政策官员卡哈·卡拉斯（Kaja Kallas）表示，该集团已经找到了能够在三月份乌克兰总统沃罗迪米尔·泽伦斯基（Volodymyr Zelenskiy）要求的两百万炮弹中的三分之二。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/eu-top-diplomat-hails-progress-in-finding-ammunition-for-ukraine</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 09:50:37 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普说，电子产品的关税将会出现</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/trump-says-tariffs-will-be-coming-for-electronics</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）承诺仍将关税申请对电话，计算机和受欢迎的消费电子产品，“在不远的将来”，将周末豁免淡化为他的整体努力，以重制美国贸易。彼得·埃斯特罗姆（Peter Elstrom）在彭博电视台上报告。 （来源：彭博）]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/trump-says-tariffs-will-be-coming-for-electronics</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 09:43:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>消息人士称</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/clariant-is-said-to-explore-ways-to-boost-valuation-after-slump</link>
      <description><![CDATA[知情人士说，在化学生产商在过去三年中损失了大约一半的价值之后，Clariant AG正在探索如何提高其股价的方法。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/clariant-is-said-to-explore-ways-to-boost-valuation-after-slump</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 06:50:56 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>随着关税燃料财政问题的关注</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/japan-super-long-yields-rise-amid-auction-extra-budget-concerns</link>
      <description><![CDATA[日本超级政府债券收益率周一激增，据推测，当局将订购额外的预算草案，以应对本月全球金融市场的关税。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/japan-super-long-yields-rise-amid-auction-extra-budget-concerns</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 06:28:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>泰国在下周进行谈判之前对美国贸易策略进行重新处理</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/thailand-finalizes-us-trade-strategy-ahead-of-talks-next-week</link>
      <description><![CDATA[泰国的目标是下周与特朗普政府官员举行会谈，以确保对其商品的36％互惠关税的救济，官员们最终确定了一系列提议，以减少与美国的460亿美元贸易盈余。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/thailand-finalizes-us-trade-strategy-ahead-of-talks-next-week</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 04:19:20 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Dollar失去的奔跑表演华尔街焦虑，关税掉头</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于特朗普政府最新的《关税政策》的最新来源使投资者对美国资产的不安增加，这笔钱被推动到新鲜的六个月低点。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 21:09:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
