    <item>
      <title>汽车到小工具：美国消费者正在输给特朗普的关税</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-07/cars-to-gadgets-what-us-consumers-may-miss-out-to-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[尽管美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）宣布对他提议的关税远足进行了90天的停顿，但如果没有按照他的政府设想的贸易协议，出口商仍在处理10％通用税的不确定性。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-07/cars-to-gadgets-what-us-consumers-may-miss-out-to-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 08:07:36 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
